<title>USA: Fluor unit gets 3-year, $500 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Fluor unit gets 3-year, $500 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fluor Corp's Fluor Daniel said Monday it had received a $500 million, three-year contract from Witco Corp to provide construction and other services in support of Witco's program to restructure and consolidate its worldwide manufacturing facilities.</p>
<p>The contract value will be added to Fluor Daniel's backlog as the work is released for execution.</p>
</text>
